# exitcode.poke -- the program chooses the broker's exit status.
#
# ctl.exit replies OK first and the broker exits afterwards, which keeps
# "exactly one reply per request" with no special case. That invariant is
# the whole deadlock proof, so it has no exceptions -- not even for the op
# whose entire job is to end the conversation.
EMIT 01 0a 00 42 53 54 4d 01 00 00 00 00 00
READ 107
#   exit 3
EMIT 02 01 00 03
READ 3
